===Go to the Marmoreal Palace{{subst:void|<!--104041314-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:'''Phainon:''' The golden threads that once bound this city have unraveled, yet no one is celebrating their freedom from control. In the empty markets and bath chambers, one feeling lingers: Unease.
:'''Phainon:''' Deep down, we all know &mdash; the last safeguard against the harm we may do to each other is gone. No divine power will protect us from the malice in our hearts. From now on, only the moral code we choose to uphold for ourselves will stand between us and the abyss.
:'''Mem:''' Phainon has a way with words.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Be quiet, and listen carefully.
::'''Mem:''' ...Oh! Alright.
::There's something special about a man of letters.
::'''Mem:''' Indeed!
::If it were me up there, I could do it too.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} There's something special about a man of letters.
::'''Mem:''' Indeed!
::If it were me up there, I could do it too.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If it were me up there, I could do it too.
:'''Mem:''' ...You think highly of yourself, don't you?
:'''Phainon:''' The Flame-Chase Journey is nearing its end, with only one Titan left for the Chrysos Heirs to conquer: {{Rubi|Aquila|Sky Titan}}.
:{{tx}}
----
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

